  "meta": {
    "document": "City of Fort Collins CO FY2026 Adopted Budget (Ord. 186, 2025)",
    "title": "Fort Collins — the money trail",
    "grand_total": 843306077,
    "year": 2026,
    "note": "The City of Fort Collins, Colorado — a home-rule, council-manager city of ~170,000. This is the adopted all-city-funds budget for 2026 (calendar fiscal year), $843.3 million, from the annual appropriations ordinance. Fort Collins owns its own electric, water, wastewater, stormwater, and broadband utilities, which are much of the total. Every fund figure ties to the ordinance’s own table and foots to the dollar."
